OL,3,GNEWSAFormer high street bank could
OL,4,Abecome office block
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former bank could become an office
OL,7,Fblock under plans submitted to a Surrey
OL,8,Flocal authority.
OL,10,FSpelthorne Borough Council has received
OL,11,Fan application to repurpose the
OL,12,Fbuilding on Staines High Street to
OL,13,Fcreate more than 13,000 square feet of
OL,14,Foffice space.
OL,16,FThe scheme will use the "building's
OL,17,Ftraditional appearance" for its
OL,18,Ffrontage and add a new third and fourth
OL,19,Ffloor, planning documents read.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
